## 6. Architectural Roadmap

```
Phase 1: Core Functional Foundations
  ├── Design curried math & spatial utilities (@pixelate2d/math)
  ├── Define driver interface contract
  ├── Build curried drawing pipeline primitives
  └── Build closure-based engine loop & CPU driver

Phase 2: React 19 Lifecycle Bindings
  ├── Build non-re-rendering useFrame & useInput hooks
  ├── Create <CpuCanvas /> with built-in pan/zoom camera
  └── Establish clean canvas teardown & resize handling

Phase 3: GPU Acceleration & Parity
  ├── Build WebGL2 dynamic batching driver
  ├── Ensure 100% API parity with CPU driver
  └── Deliver <GpuCanvas /> React component

```